Package: devjam-science-experiment-mode-rtirq
Version: 1.47-1
Section: oldlibs
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: devjam-science-experiment-mode
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Transitional package for devjam-science-experiment-mode
 This package has been split into devjam-science-experiment-mode
 (experiment mode, including switch-rtirq) and
 devjam-system-config-rtirq (the rtirq configuration, which can also be
 installed without experiment mode). It pulls in both packages and can
 be removed safely.
